{"id":"5939","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5939_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-anti-crepuscular-rays_clouds-photometeors.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片是侵入的大范围高积云层，呈融合的圆形云团。云幂仪资料标示出云底高度为2400米（8000英尺）；这与早期在附近的高空探测结果相一致。</p>\n<p>此云整体很厚，可完全遮挡太阳的位置。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在东南地平线附近</span>可看到云层的前缘，这可证实云层仍在侵入过程中。在对日点方向还可看到轻微的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">反曙暮辉</span>实例。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，布罗德梅多斯","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 25'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 51'' E","date":"20 September 2012 1617 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.2"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5939_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-anti-crepuscular-rays_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>低压槽以及伴随的低压系统正在向东抵近，导致不稳定天气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2012，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5939_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-opacus-and-anti-crepuscular-rays_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在3200米的几乎饱和层（97%RH）</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}